{
  "version": 1.1,
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "movi-player",
      "description": {
        "kind": "markdown",
        "value": "Movi Player — a WASM + WebCodecs video player custom element.\n\nPlays formats the browser cannot (MKV, HEVC, AV1, TrueHD/DTS, …) on a WebGL2 canvas, with adaptive quality, HDR, subtitles and a full built-in UI."
      },
      "attributes": [
        {
          "name": "src",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Specifies the video source URL or File object."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#src"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "autopictureinpicture",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Enter Picture-in-Picture automatically when the tab is hidden, and leave it on"
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#autopictureinpicture"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "autoplay",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Starts playback automatically when loaded."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#autoplay"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "controls",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Shows/hides the built-in UI controls."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#controls"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "loop",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Restarts playback when video ends."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#loop"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "muted",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Mutes audio by default."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#muted"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "playsinline",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Prevents auto-fullscreen on iOS (plays inline instead). It also — on **any touch"
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#playsinline"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "preload",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Hints how much data to buffer initially."
          },
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "none",
              "description": {
                "kind": "markdown",
                "value": "Don't preload"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "metadata",
              "description": {
                "kind": "markdown",
                "value": "(default) - Load metadata only"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "auto",
              "description": {
                "kind": "markdown",
                "value": "Buffer as much as possible"
              }
            }
          ],
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#preload"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "probesize",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "How far the demuxer may read before it says what the streams are."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#probesize"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "probeduration",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "How much media the demuxer may analyse before it says what the streams are, in"
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#probeduration"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "poster",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Displays an image before playback starts."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#poster"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "posterfit",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "How the poster is fitted, when it should not be fitted the way the video is."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#posterfit"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "width",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Sets element dimensions (CSS preferred)."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#width"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "height",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Sets element dimensions (CSS preferred)."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#height"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "crossorigin",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "CORS mode for cross-origin videos."
          },
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "anonymous",
              "description": {
                "kind": "markdown",
                "value": "No credentials"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "use-credentials",
              "description": {
                "kind": "markdown",
                "value": "Include credentials"
              }
            }
          ],
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#crossorigin"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "volume",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Sets the initial audio volume (0.0 to 1.0). User preference persists across reloads via OPFS and overrides this default on subsequent loads."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#volume"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "playbackrate",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Sets the initial playback speed. Persists across reloads like `volume`."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#playbackrate"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "subtitledelay",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Shifts subtitle timing relative to video, in seconds. Sign matches VLC and mpv: **positive** values shift subtitles **later**, negative shifts them earlier."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#subtitledelay"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "subtitlesize",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Subtitle size multiplier"
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#subtitlesize"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "subtitlecolor",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Subtitle text color"
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#subtitlecolor"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "subtitlebg",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Subtitle background opacity (0..1)"
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#subtitlebg"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "subtitleedge",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Subtitle edge style"
          },
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "none"
            },
            {
              "name": "shadow"
            },
            {
              "name": "outline"
            },
            {
              "name": "raised"
            }
          ],
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#subtitleedge"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "ambientmode",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Enables ambient background effects."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#ambientmode"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "ambientwrapper",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Specifies external element for ambient effects."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#ambientwrapper"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "cropbars",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Crops the black bars that are part of the **picture**."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#cropbars"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "backgroundplay",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Lets [`autoplay`](#autoplay) start while the tab is **hidden**."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#backgroundplay"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "bindav",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Stalls the sound and the picture **together**. On by default."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#bindav"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "renderer",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Chooses the rendering backend."
          },
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "canvas",
              "description": {
                "kind": "markdown",
                "value": "(default) — WebGL2 canvas rendering with full features (HDR, rotation, snapshots, ambient mode)"
              }
            }
          ],
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#renderer"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "objectfit",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Controls how video fills the canvas."
          },
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "contain",
              "description": {
                "kind": "markdown",
                "value": "(default) - Fit within bounds, maintain aspect ratio"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "cover",
              "description": {
                "kind": "markdown",
                "value": "Fill bounds, crop if necessary"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "fill",
              "description": {
                "kind": "markdown",
                "value": "Stretch to fill bounds (may distort)"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "zoom",
              "description": {
                "kind": "markdown",
                "value": "Slightly zoomed in (1.1x)"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "control",
              "description": {
                "kind": "markdown",
                "value": "User can pinch/zoom to adjust"
              }
            }
          ],
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#objectfit"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "rotate",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Rotate video, in degrees (snaps to a quarter-turn)"
          },
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "0"
            },
            {
              "name": "90"
            },
            {
              "name": "180"
            },
            {
              "name": "270"
            }
          ],
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#rotate"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "thumb",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Generates thumbnails on demand (used internally for preview)."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#thumb"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "hdr",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Enables/disables HDR rendering."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#hdr"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "theme",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Sets the UI theme."
          },
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "dark",
              "description": {
                "kind": "markdown",
                "value": "(default)"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "light"
            }
          ],
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#theme"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "sw",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Forces software decoding (using FFmpeg WASM) instead of hardware-accelerated WebCodecs."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#sw"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "fps",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Overrides the video frame rate with a custom value."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#fps"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "gesturefs",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "**Deprecated** — use `playsinline`"
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#gesturefs"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "nohotkeys",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Disables all keyboard shortcuts for playback control."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#nohotkeys"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "startat",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Specifies the time (in seconds) where playback should start."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#startat"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "fastseek",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Enables fast seek controls for quick ±10s navigation."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#fastseek"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "doubletap",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Enables/disables double-tap to seek gesture."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#doubletap"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "themecolor",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Sets the player's accent colors — one or two, separated by a space."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#themecolor"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "buffersize",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Target prefetch window in **megabytes** — how far ahead of playback the source should try to keep buffered."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#buffersize"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "title",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Sets the video title shown in the in-player overlay. Unlike the global HTML `title` attribute, this does **not** trigger a native browser tooltip on hover."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#title"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "showtitle",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Shows the title bar overlay at the top of the player."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#showtitle"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "titlemode",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Decides where the title bar is allowed to appear, and whether it carries a back arrow. Space- or comma-separated tokens, in any order:"
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#titlemode"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "chapters",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Chapters that aren't in the media file. The player already reads chapter atoms out of MKV/MP4 containers; this is for the sources that keep them somewhere else — YouTube in the watch page, a CMS in its own database. Each entry is `{title, start, end?, image?}`, where `image` is artwork the timeline tile shows in place of a frame decoded at `start`."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#chapters"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "resume",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Saves playback position to localStorage and shows a resume dialog on reload."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#resume"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "stablevolume",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Enables loudness normalization (DynamicsCompressorNode). Reduces loud scenes and boosts quiet ones."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#stablevolume"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "encrypted",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Enables encrypted video playback. Requires `tokenurl` and `videourl` attributes."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#encrypted"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "tokenurl",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Token endpoint URL for encrypted playback. Server returns HMAC signing secret and file metadata."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#tokenurl"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "videourl",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Video endpoint URL for encrypted playback. Chunks are served with token + HMAC validation."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#videourl"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "videoid",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Video identifier sent to the token server. Maps to a specific encrypted file on the server."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#videoid"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "drm",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Enables DRM playback mode for HLS streams. When set, the player switches to a native `<video>` element + EME API instead of the canvas pipeline. Canvas-only features (rotation, snapshots) are disabled in this mode."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#drm"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "licenseurl",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Widevine/FairPlay license server URL for DRM playback. Required when `drm` is set."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#licenseurl"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "licenseheaders",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Extra HTTP headers sent with the **DRM license request only** — the auth token, customer ID or provider-specific header your license server expects. A JSON object string; invalid JSON is ignored with a console warning."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#licenseheaders"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "headers",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Custom HTTP headers applied to **every** media network request — adaptive-stream manifests *and* their segments (Shaka request filter, hls.js `xhrSetup`, dash.js request interceptor), progressive HTTP, thumbnails, and the encrypted source (stream GET + token refresh). Use it to carry auth tokens, signed-URL headers, or API keys."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#headers"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "audioonly",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Data-saver mode — play only the audio and skip the video decode to save CPU and bandwidth. Toggleable live (no reload for muxed/file sources)."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#audioonly"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "lcevc",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Enables MPEG-5 Part 2 **LCEVC** enhancement-layer decoding for adaptive streams. Requires the external `lcevc_dec.js` library — point `lcevcurl` at it to lazy-load, or expose a global `LCEVCdec`."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#lcevc"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "lcevcurl",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Enables MPEG-5 Part 2 **LCEVC** enhancement-layer decoding for adaptive streams. Requires the external `lcevc_dec.js` library — point `lcevcurl` at it to lazy-load, or expose a global `LCEVCdec`."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#lcevcurl"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "postertime",
          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Generates a native-resolution poster frame from a timestamp instead of (or as a fallback for) `poster`. Useful when you don't have a pre-rendered thumbnail but want to show a representative frame."
          },
          "references": [
            {
              "name": "Documentation",
              "url": "https://moviplayer.com/docs/api/element#postertime"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "vr",
