          "description": {
            "kind": "markdown",
            "value": "Route audio to a specific output device (speakers, Bluetooth, a virtual device) via `AudioContext.setSinkId`. Accepts a concrete `deviceId` **or** a **label substring** (case-insensitive) — handy because device ids are session-salted, so a substring like `\"Headphones\"` reliably targets the same physical device across reloads. `\"\"` / `\"default\"` routes to the system default."
